cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EEG Motor Imagery Classification with Log-Covariance Features and XGBoost"
abstract: >-
  A small cross-subject EEG motor imagery classifier (left hand, right hand,
  both hands, both feet) with participant-grouped cross-validation, plus a
  one-command reproduction on the public PhysioNet EEG Motor
  Movement/Imagery Database.
